HARDWARE (H/W) PATHS:
- Climate + Cities: Resilient campuses, mobility, public systems.
- Health & Triage: Care access, diagnostics, smart bio-wearables.
- Design Systems: Reusable physical form factors, enclosures.
- Hardware Rigs: Connected devices, sensors, IoT nodes.

